# The Road Forks, the Lioumere killed with its status 1 (mission.cop.the_road_forks#kill1). A level 75 Warrior of
# Windurst with 3-3 current (a GM). Attohwa Chasm, Windurst status 8: Loose Sand spawns and claims the Lioumere; the
# mission Status set to 1 (a GM); the Lioumere killed: nothing.
lists AttohwaChasm/Loose_Sand/onTrigger AttohwaChasm/Lioumere/onMobDeath
char zone=AttohwaChasm pos=478.8,20,41.7 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
mission Cop TheRoadForks current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
missionstatus Cop 8 pos=1               # a GM
trigger Loose_Sand here                 # 8: the Lioumere spawned and claimed
finish-if-event
charvar Mission[6][325]Status 1         # a GM
kill LIOUMERE                           # status 1: nothing
